Package: doubletRate
Title: RNA-only doublet scores, calls, and predicted rates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("bio-apple", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Description: Score every cell in one already cell-called RNA Sample, make a
    data-driven Call per Detector, and report a Predicted Doublet Rate. Does
    not remove cells and does not fuse Detectors. Seurat and SingleCellExperiment
    objects are annotated in place via python -m doublet_rate. Missing Python
    is a hard failure; missing detector packages skip that Detector.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports: Matrix
Suggests:
    BiocParallel,
    DoubletFinder,
    S4Vectors,
    Seurat,
    SingleCellExperiment,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    scDblFinder,
    scds
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
